permit (principal is User, action == Action::"viewApplicantData", resource is ApplicantRecord)
when { ((((principal.clearance == 0) || (principal.clearance == 1) || (principal.clearance == 2)) && ((resource.dataSensitivity == 0) || (resource.dataSensitivity == 1) || (resource.dataSensitivity == 2))) && ((principal.roles.contains(Role::"AdjudicationOfficer") || principal.roles.contains(Role::"SupervisoryOfficer") || principal.roles.contains(Role::"BackgroundInvestigator"))) && (!(true) || (principal.clearance >= resource.dataSensitivity)) && (((("active" == "sealed") && (resource.status == ApplicantRecordStatusValue::"sealed")) || (("active" == "active") && (resource.status == ApplicantRecordStatusValue::"active")) || (("active" == "purged") && (resource.status == ApplicantRecordStatusValue::"purged")))) && ((principal.roles.contains(Role::"SupervisoryOfficer"))) && (resource.needToKnowTeam.contains(principal)) && (context.onGovNetwork)) };
